== Match report ==

=== Balisca 4–0 Kaneda ===
[[Balisca national football team|Balisca]] were the outstanding team on the day in [[Castejón]], with a commanding performance that kept [[Kaneda national football team|Kaneda]] pinned back for long stretches. Four unanswered goals gave the co-hosts a statement win and a strong position in Group A.

=== Volisania 2–1 Kalisongo ===
[[Volisania national football team|Volisania]] recovered from an early setback against [[Kalisongo national football team|Kalisongo]] in [[Macaio]] and turned the match around after the break. The reigning group pace-setters kept their composure to collect another important victory.

=== Ayorin 1–1 Dagit ===
[[Ayorin national football team|Ayorin]] and [[Dagit national football team|Dagit]] played out a tight and balanced contest in [[Alessandria]]. Dagit briefly looked set for victory after taking the lead, but Ayorin found an equaliser to ensure the points were shared.

=== Sanrobonia 0–0 Tamazgha ===
[[Sanrobonia national football team|Sanrobonia]] and [[Tamazgha national football team|Tamazgha]] were locked in a disciplined tactical battle in [[Martapura]], but neither side could break through. The goalless draw kept the group finely poised heading into the final round of matches.

=== Okaiken 1–1 Sanyan ===
[[Okaiken national football team|Okaiken]] and [[Sanyan national football team|Sanyan]] produced a tense final fixture in [[Axarquía]]. Okaiken thought they had done enough after taking the lead, but Sanyan rescued a point late on to keep the game level.

=== Balboa 1–0 Nakamizu ===
[[Balboa national football team|Balboa]] edged [[Nakamizu national football team|Nakamizu]] in [[Concepción]] thanks to a single decisive goal. The result gave Balboa a narrow but deserved win in a closely fought match.

== Summary ==

Matchday 3 produced 12 goals, with [[Balisca national football team|Balisca]]'s 4–0 win over [[Kaneda national football team|Kaneda]] the standout result of the day. [[Volisania national football team|Volisania]] also collected an important comeback win, while [[Ayorin national football team|Ayorin]], [[Sanrobonia national football team|Sanrobonia]], [[Okaiken national football team|Okaiken]], and [[Balboa national football team|Balboa]] all picked up points in tightly contested fixtures.

